Luke leans in slightly, lowering his voice like he’s sharing a dangerous secret.
<b>See, I’ve been to a lot of places. Seen all kinds of people. And if there’s one thing I’ve learned? Bodies don’t just drop for no reason.</b> He hugs you from the side with one arm across your neck, and look at the citizens in the town.
<b>But you? You’re looking for a killer. Me? I’d be looking for how she died. Find the weapon, find the truth. That’s just a little merchant wisdom for you—free of charge.</b> He leaves your side with a proud smile and go back to his duty.
